     "body": "From 塔哥 on Discord (#feedback): the models a gateway key may use (#882) are picked from a plain menu (`plugins/gateway/keys.js`, `gatewayModelsBadge`). With many providers it is a long flat list.\n\nDecision: reuse the model picker the Agents page uses (search, grouped by provider, groups listed apart), with the key's accounts (#905) kept as they are in the menu now. No new UI pattern.\n\nCheck: with 10+ providers, a key's models can be found by typing; picked models and groups save as `access.Key.Models` exactly as now; GUI tests in both engines, narrow width, every language.\n",
